Package: bearparser
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Parse PE file contents
 bearcommander is the command-line interface to bearparser, a portable
 executable parsing library by hasherezade. This package builds it from
 source, replacing the earlier package that shipped a prebuilt binary.
